  annotation = {中文辅助译名：迭代自适应逆滤波中声道模型阶数的确定},
  abstract = {Abstract This paper is part of a special issue on Music Technology. Accurate estimation of glottal wave is an important method for singing voice analysis via voicing patterns. In this paper, an optimising method is proposed for automatic determination of vocal tract linear prediction analysis order that follows the specific situation of different voicing scenes based on Iterative Adaptive Inverse Filtering (IAIF) aiming at getting a more accurate glottal wave from speech or singing voice signal in a non‐invasive way. In comparison with existing methods that use fixed experience order, the proposed method can achieve up to 8.41% improvement in correlation coefficient with the real glottal wave.},
}

